{"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Getting Started with OUDS","images":[{"identifier":"ic_unified_ds.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"ic_unified_ds.png","type":"card"}],"modules":[{"name":"Welcome to Orange Unified Design System"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Integrate OUDS","anchor":"Integrate-OUDS","type":"heading","level":2},{"text":"Use Swift Package Manager","anchor":"Use-Swift-Package-Manager","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want to add the iOS library of "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Unified Design System","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", you need to add our "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift Package","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" into your project."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To do that, add a new "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"package dependency"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to your "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode"}]},{"type":"text","text":" project by refering to it by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You are free to choose whether or not you want a branch or a specific tag, pick the solution you want."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios\/wiki\/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for more details about versions, releases and tags. You can find release tags (e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.0.0"}]},{"type":"text","text":") and release candidates tags (e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.0.0-rc3"}]},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"text":"Import the librairies you need","anchor":"Import-the-librairies-you-need","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You should use one (or several) of the following imports for your needs, which are basically "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift Package","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" products."}]},{"style":"tip","type":"aside","name":"Tip","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We recommend to embed in your apps only the ones you need to avoid to embed useless assets."}]}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import OUDSThemesContract \/\/ If you want to define your theme, use themes or OUDSThemeableView","import OUDSModules \/\/ To use modules","import OUDSComponents \/\/ To use components","import OUDSThemesOrange \/\/ To use the default Orange theme","import OUDSThemesOrangeCompact \/\/ To use the Orange Compact theme","import OUDSThemesSosh \/\/ To use the Sosh theme","import OUDSThemesWireframe \/\/ To use the Wireframe theme","import OUDSTokensComponent \/\/ If you need to override or use directly components tokens","import OUDSTokenSemantic \/\/ If you need to override or use directly semantic tokens","import OUDSTokensRaw \/\/ If you need to override or use directly raw tokens","import OUDSFoundations \/\/ For some utilities"]},{"text":"Or more simple, import umbrella library","anchor":"Or-more-simple-import-umbrella-library","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"We do not recommend this solution because from our point of view use of tailored imports is better to import only the needed elements.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use of umbrella products can increase app sizes and needed storage because it emebds plenty of assets (images, fonts, etc.)","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"and useless constants.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Note"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Import the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}]},{"text":" product which suits your needs:","type":"text"}]},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Umbrella"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSSwiftUI","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All librairies listed above and all themes","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSSwiftUIOrange","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All librairies listed above but with only Orange and Orange Compact themes","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDSSwiftUIWireframe","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All librairies listed above but with only Wireframe theme","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDSSwiftUIOrangeSosh"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All librairies listed above but with only Orange and Sosh themes","type":"text"}]}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"anchor":"Chose-your-theme","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Chose your theme"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Unified Design System","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" framework provides today four themes:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Theme","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The default one for Orange products and can be enriched \/ derivated","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Compact","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For some Orange products with heavy \/ rich UI and dimensions constraints","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sosh"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For Sosh products","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Wireframe"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For mockups, prototypes and prooves of concepts witouth Orange-flavoured styles"}]}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Apply-a-theme","text":"Apply a theme","level":3},{"type":"row","columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You will need to use for your application root view the "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/oudsthemeableview\/","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\/documentation\/ouds\/themes","type":"reference"},{"text":" also.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This special view is here to define some elements as environment variables and injects the choosen theme.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"size":1,"content":[{"syntax":"swift","code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","       WindowGroup {","          OUDSThemeableView(theme: OrangeTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","          }","       }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"numberOfColumns":2},{"type":"row","columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then get the current applied theme in your views and use the tokens you want."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The tokens are wrapped in providers with clear names, you only need to choose the ones you want."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"size":1,"content":[{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Use it in views as an environment variable","@Environment(\\.theme) var theme"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"numberOfColumns":2},{"style":"tip","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep in mind only one theme can be used within one "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"name":"Tip"},{"level":3,"text":"Trick for Xcode Preview","type":"heading","anchor":"Trick-for-Xcode-Preview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you use Xcode "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"#Preview"},{"type":"text","text":" blocks, you will have to be sure the theme is instanciated and injected through the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because it is not possible today to override the legit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"#Preview"},{"type":"text","text":" block, you can instead use some of our utilities to wrap your content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inside the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":" automatically. These utilities come with the themes modules. Without them you may face errors about undefined theme."}]},{"code":["\/\/ Apply Orange theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .orangePreview()","}","","\/\/ Apply Orange Compact theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .orangeCompactPreview()","}","","\/\/ Apply Sosh theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .soshPreview()","}","","\/\/ Apply Wireframe theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .wireframePreview()","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How to add the package as dependency, import libraries and use theme and components for your apps."}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/do